### Transaction API Tests

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7071/api

### Get all transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

### Get specific transaction by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1

### Create a new transaction (Stock In)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "fromLocationId": null,
  "toLocationId": 1,
  "quantity": 100,
  "transactionType": 1,
  "expiryDate": "2025-12-31T00:00:00"
}

### Create a transfer transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "fromLocationId": 1,
  "toLocationId": 2,
  "quantity": 50,
  "transactionType": 3,
  "expiryDate": "2025-12-31T00:00:00"
}

### Create a stock out transaction (Sale)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "fromLocationId": 1,
  "toLocationId": null,
  "quantity": 25,
  "transactionType": 2,
  "expiryDate": null
}

### Update a transaction
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "fromLocationId": 1,
  "toLocationId": 2,
  "quantity": 75,
  "transactionType": 3,
  "expiryDate": "2025-11-30T00:00:00"
}

### Delete a transaction
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/3

### Test creating transaction with invalid product
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 999,
  "fromLocationId": 1,
  "toLocationId": 2,
  "quantity": 10,
  "transactionType": 3,
  "expiryDate": null
}

### Test creating transaction with invalid location
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "fromLocationId": 999,
  "toLocationId": 1,
  "quantity": 10,
  "transactionType": 3,
  "expiryDate": null
}

### Test creating transaction with negative quantity
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "fromLocationId": 1,
  "toLocationId": 2,
  "quantity": -10,
  "transactionType": 3,
  "expiryDate": null
}
